  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Armenia - support to refugee populations and host communities in Ararat and Armavir regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims at facilitating the labour market integration of refugees in the most vulnerable situations and vulnerable host population (around 10 per cent) in local communities. This will contribute to increasing refugees&#x2019; protection levels, expanding their access to socioeconomic rights and opportunities, decreasing their dependence on humanitarian aid, re-establishing a sense of normalcy in their lives and diminishing the pressure on public budgets and on host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
